# Documentation artifact budget: 4 MiB total, including real screenshots and validation records.
!/artifacts/
!/artifacts/**
# Explicit submission path budget: 0 bytes for each generated path below, at every nesting level.
# dist/ has a reserved budget of 512 KiB and is deliberately included in the submission.
**/node_modules/
**/.cache/
**/.vite/
**/.npm/
**/coverage/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
# This assignment removes test/scratch/ before submission; none of it is a runtime dependency.
/test/scratch/
